<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- M. Stanley ups Morton Int'l.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- M. Stanley ups Morton Int'l.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Morton International Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/8 to 40-7/8 by mid-morning.</p>
